    <section id="content" class="roosC container">
      <h5>Lowest Test Cost Per Device</h5>
      <p>
        RI's per-piece cycle time for production test is typically sub-1 second which
        includes generating and logging complete results data. A full characterization
        test may take 3 to 5 seconds. RI systems have demonstrated performance in excess
        of 10 million pieces per year, over 75,000 parts per day. This throughput
        combined with system prices starting under six hundred thousand dollars equates
        to the lowest test cost per device on the market.
      </p>
      <h5>Maximum Uptime</h5>
      <p>
        RI designs its RF sources, signal paths, and programmable DUT controller for
        maximum stability over temperature and time. System errors are minimized through
        design and removed via software. While frequent calibration is a requirement of
        most T & M equipment, RI has reduced it to a scheduled maintenance item. MTBF's
        are above 10,000 hours and increasing while maintenance cycles are semiannual.
        Reliability is a primary feature of the RI system. All components, including any
        custom filtering specified by customers, are engineered for dependability.
      </p>
      <h5>Performance Guaranteed</h5>
      <p>
        The acceptance test for every RI system is the first production run. From
        pre-shipment integration acceptance through installation, on-site start up
        training and test plan development to final acceptance, RI professionals
        personally guarantee system performance and customer satisfaction.
      </p>

    </section> <!-- End of #content section-->
</Base>
